Chapter: RtSmoke

 Combined punctual error checks: heap alloc (6002), calls unsafe (6001),
 unbounded recursion (6005), bare I/O (6004), closure (6003).

Section: Definitions

  format-fancy : Integer -> Text
  format-fancy (n) = "value: " & show n

  punctual bad-rt-alloc : List Integer -> List Integer
  bad-rt-alloc (xs) = list-push xs 42

  punctual bad-rt-caller : Integer -> Text
  bad-rt-caller (x) = format-fancy x

  punctual count-down : Integer -> Integer
  count-down (n) =
   if n == 0 then 0
   else count-down (n - 1)

  punctual bad-rt-io : Integer -> [Console] Text
  bad-rt-io (n) = show n

  punctual bad-rt-closure : Integer -> Integer
  bad-rt-closure (n) = let f = \x -> x + 1 in f n

  opening : Integer = 0

